[en.FOCUS_C12_STONE_SOUP_RELIEF_AGENCY]
Stone Soup Relief Agency

[en.FOCUS_C12_STONE_SOUP_RELIEF_AGENCY_desc]
The peculiar cuisine of the Pie family seemed like something out of a tall tale to other ponies, but in reality, carefully selected special stones, after undergoing the mysterious cooking methods of the Pie family, could indeed provide sustenance, and even tasted quite good.\nEstablishing numerous relief centers in pony settlements could greatly help many ponies get through these difficult times.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_STONE_SOUP_RELIEF_AGENCY]
石头汤救济处

[zh.FOCUS_C12_STONE_SOUP_RELIEF_AGENCY_desc]
这种派家族的奇特食物在其他小马眼中仿佛天荒夜谈，但事实上，精心挑选的特殊石块在派家族神秘的烹制后确实可以饱腹，甚至味道还不错。\n如果能小马定居点建立许多救济处，可以大大帮助许多小马度过这段艰难的日子。

